The name this member carries on a MessagePack wire: the one the document publishes, which is the
one the server pins with [Key("...")] too. property.Name is the JSON name - the same value the
generated [JsonPropertyName] is written from - and property.PropertyName is the C# identifier.
{%- endcomment -%}
[MessagePack.Key("{{ property.Name }}")]
